  "rating": "5",
  "item_short_desc": "<p>Rothco's 550lb Type III Paracord is a must-have multifunctional tool for your survival gear. With an unbeatable tensile strength of 550 lbs, this paracord is essential for service personnel, backpackers, campers, and outdoor enthusiasts. The seven-strand construction allows disassembly for various applications like fishing line, boot laces, and sewing yarn. Craft bracelets, keychains, and accessories with this versatile utility cord. Approximately 5/32 inches in diameter, it's a reliable addition to your bug-out bag, rucksack, and survival gear.</p>",
  "no_ratings": "0",
  "sort_order": "12316",
  "description": "<p>Rothco's 550lb Type III Paracord is a must-have multifunctional tool for your survival gear. With an unbeatable tensile strength of 550 lbs, this paracord is essential for service personnel, backpackers, campers, and outdoor enthusiasts. The seven-strand construction allows disassembly for various applications like fishing line, boot laces, and sewing yarn. Craft bracelets, keychains, and accessories with this versatile utility cord. Approximately 5/32 inches in diameter, it's a reliable addition to your bug-out bag, rucksack, and survival gear. Elevate your everyday carry (EDC) with Rothco's essential 550lb Type III Paracord.</p>",
